{
  "_comment": [
    "Source-of-truth manifest for every downloaded art asset in the UE port.",
    "download_assets.py fetches these URLs into the local asset cache",
    "(SHITFIRE_ASSET_CACHE, default %LOCALAPPDATA%/shitfire-asset-cache);",
    "import_assets.py imports from that cache into /Game. Raw archives are",
    "NEVER committed - only the imported .uassets (LFS), each covered by",
    "port/CREDITS.md and port/unreal/uasset-allowlist.txt.",
    "License rails (UNREAL_RESEARCH.md 7/11): CC0 preferred, CC-BY needs the",
    "credit line in CREDITS.md, no GPL / CC-BY-SA / NC / ND, nothing",
    "license-less, nothing extracted from Arma/DCS.",
    "Every model carries vis {nvg: 0..1 tube luminance, th: [r,g,b] thermal",
    "colour} from the browser tables (src/js/04-world.js:93-159); it lands on",
    "the model's MI_* instances of M_ShitfireMaster as VisNvg/VisThermal.",
    "A model without vis makes import_assets.py raise - never a default.",
    "reparent_imported_materials: true = the pack's own materials are",
    "imported, each mesh slot gets an MI_<Mesh>_<slot> of the master with",
    "the slot's texture/baseColorFactor, then the Interchange materials are",
    "deleted (textures kept). Absent/false = the vegetation path (palette",
    "texture + MI_<Model>_<slot> under dest, import folder deleted)."
  ],
